MediaTek hf_manager: expose native accelerometer and ALS through SensorProxy.

Use the exact sensor/2.0 ABI, metadata gain, existing mount matrices and
claim/refcount lifecycle. Explicitly disable on release/close and reconcile
orphaned kernel state when opening. No synthetic readings or calibration writes.
Support multiple sensor types on the same hotplugged hub.

